The persistent error shows the validator's expected match population for this obligation is fixed to exactly the three rows bound under `target_roles` (priya_membership, lukas_membership, robert_admin_membership) — not the full 19-row workspace roster. The selector must therefore be scoped to resolve exactly those three root rows (while still traversing the full designated route to establish the workspace-pinning witness), rather than the entire team's membership.

```json
